  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your strike channels dread: the target takes an extra 1d6 Necrotic damage from the attack and must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the &amp;Reference[frightened apply=false]{Frightened} condition until the spell ends. While Frightened this way, it repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the spell on itself on a success.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-cISFY9e11q36Zbbo\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Delete the Frightened effect when the target succeeds on <em>Repeat Save</em>.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
